{
  "borough": "Barking And Dagenham",
  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The first floor&amp;nbsp;rear extension, by reason of its excessive bulking and massing&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;in combination with the existing side extension and ground floor rear extension&lt;/span&gt;,&amp;nbsp;would appear&amp;nbsp;an overly dominant addition in relation to the size of the modest end of terrace host dwelling and&amp;nbsp;the surrounding modest terrace dwellings. As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- Policies D1, D4, D5 and D6 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- Policies DMD1, DMD5 and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;SP2&amp;nbsp;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;div&gt;The scale, siting and design of the proposed development would result in unacceptable loss of daylight, overshadowing,&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;loss of outlook and overbearing impacts&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;impacts to no.65 &amp;amp; 71 Surrey Road. Therefore, the proposal would constitute unneighbourly development which is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies DMD1, DMD5 and DMSI3 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
